    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## The Cozy Nook: Designing for Jada\r\n\r\n**The User:** Jada owns \"The Purr-fect Page,\" a cat café and bookstore where customers can rent cozy reading nooks. She needs a booking system with a \"Cottagecore\" vibe.\r\n\r\n**Step 1.** Prompt AI to generate your web app layout (HTML).\r\n\r\n::: details [**What should I write in my prompt?**]\r\nThink about it:\r\n> What information (e.g., cat names, available time slots, waitlist) does the booking system keep track of?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n**Step 2.** Prompt AI to generate your page style (CSS).\r\n\r\n::: details [**What should I write in my prompt?**]\r\nThink about it:\r\n> What specific fonts, colors, and text should the page use to feel cozy?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n**Step 3.** Add images to your site.\r\n\r\n**Step 4.** Use your handout checklist to add more features to your web page.",
